{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33382","headline":"送羊振文先辈往桂阳归觐 · 司马都","name":"送羊振文先辈往桂阳归觐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此去欢荣冠士林，离筵休恨酒杯深。\n云梯万仞初高步，月桂余香尚满襟。\n鸣櫂晓冲苍霭发，落帆寒动白华吟。\n君家祖德惟清苦，却笑当时问绢心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司马都","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33382.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33382","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}